@startuml HU07_Gestion_Pago_Cuotas
title HU-07 — Gestión y Pago de Cuotas\nDIP (IPaymentProcessor) + índice compuesto (Sprint 1 · DeFi360)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2E75B6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF3FB
skinparam noteBorderColor #F0A500
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1

actor       "Prestatario"                     as User
boundary    "Frontend (React)"               as UI
control     "loanController"                 as LC
participant "<<interface>>\nIPaymentProcessor" as IPP
participant "StandardPaymentProcessor"       as SPP
database    "PostgreSQL\n(Loan, Wallet, Offer)" as DB

autonumber

note over LC, IPP
  loanController.payLoan(paymentProcessor = new StandardPaymentProcessor())
  depende de IPaymentProcessor (DIP). El processor resuelve lender/borrower
  del propio préstamo (fix bug Fase A: ya no llega lenderId undefined).
end note

User -> UI : Ingresa monto de cuota
UI -> UI : valida monto > 0
UI -> LC : POST /api/loans/{id}/pay { amount } (JWT)

LC -> IPP : processPayment({ loanId, amount, borrowerId: req.user.id })
IPP -> SPP : processPayment(...)
activate SPP

SPP -> DB : Loan.findByPk(loanId, include Offer)
note right of DB
  Índice compuesto
  (borrower_id, status, end_date)
  acelera consultas del ciclo de pago.
end note
DB --> SPP : loan (+ Offer)

SPP -> SPP : resolvedBorrowerId = borrowerId ?? loan.borrowerId\nresolvedLenderId = lenderId ?? loan.lenderId

alt préstamo inactivo / no autorizado / saldo insuficiente
    SPP --> LC : throw Error(...)
    LC --> UI : 400 { message }
else pago válido
    SPP -> DB : borrowerWallet.update(availableBalance -= amount)
    SPP -> DB : lenderWallet.update(availableBalance += amount, blockedBalance -= amount)
    SPP -> SPP : recalculateLTV(newRemainingBalance, collateralAmount)
    SPP -> DB : loan.update(remainingBalance, ltv, status)
    DB --> SPP : OK
    SPP --> LC : { transactionId, newRemainingBalance, newLTV, loanStatus }
    deactivate SPP
    LC --> UI : 200 { receipt }
    UI --> User : Saldo restante y LTV actualizados
end

note over User, DB
  Gracias al DIP, IPaymentProcessor se mockea en pruebas.
  QA: src/test/StandardPaymentProcessor.test.js, loanController.test.js.
end note

@enduml
